   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Hi unmarked users,<div><br></div><div>I&#39;m trying to teach myself how to implement build JAGS models in R and I was curious if anyone knew of any good online</div><div>resources/tutorials for how to build occupancy and n-mixture models using jagsUI. Thoughts?</div><div><br></div><div>Thanks,</div><div><br></div><div>Josh</div></div>"
    ]
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "piSDwZ3eAAAJ",
   "from": "Kery Marc",
