   "date": "2020-08-05T07:17:27Z",
   "subject": "AW: [unmarked] JAGs examples",
   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<div lang=\"EN-US\" link=\"blue\" vlink=\"purple\">\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;color:#1f497d\">Dear Josh,<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;color:#1f497d\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;color:#1f497d\">as a minimum, you could take the published code for Bayesian analysis using JAGS from R from our BPA and AHM1 books, see here:<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p><u></u><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;color:#1f497d\"><span>-<span style=\"font:7.0pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">         \r\n</span></span></span><u></u><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;color:#1f497d\"><a href=\"https://www.vogelwarte.ch/de/projekte/publikationen/bpa/code-for-running-bpa-using-jags\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://www.vogelwarte.ch/de/projekte/publikationen/bpa/code-for-running-bpa-using-jags&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792450449161000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2bUzSEwJ8D1A-bz1HNh84R\">https://www.vogelwarte.ch/de/projekte/publikationen/bpa/code-for-running-bpa-using-jags</a>.\r\n Here, we still use R2jags, but doing it in jagsUI (our current preference for an R-JAGS interface) is really easy if you have code for R2jags.<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p><u></u><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;color:#1f497d\"><span>-<span style=\"font:7.0pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">         \r\n</span></span></span><u></u><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;color:#1f497d\"><a href=\"https://www.mbr-pwrc.usgs.gov/pubanalysis/keryroylebook/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://www.mbr-pwrc.usgs.gov/pubanalysis/keryroylebook/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792450449161000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0S2NU4Q6oOENeALYsgYJ9T\">https://www.mbr-pwrc.usgs.gov/pubanalysis/keryroylebook/</a>. Lots of code here.<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;color:#1f497d\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;color:#1f497d\">Best regards  -- Marc<u></u><u></u></span></p></div></div>"
    ],
