     "<div><div style=\"font-family:Verdana;font-size:12.0px\"><div>Dear Josh</div>\r\n\r\n<div> </div>\r\n\r\n<div>The website of Mike Meredith <a href=\"https://mmeredith.net/index.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://mmeredith.net/index.htm&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792450449167000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0FfJ_HLt0JVyJYNA35OuH7\">https://mmeredith.net/index.htm</a> is also useful.</div>\r\n\r\n<div> </div>\r\n\r\n<div>Best wishes</div>\r\n\r\n<div>Beni</div>\r\n\r\n<div> </div>\r\n\r\n<div> \r\n<div> \r\n<div name=\"quote\" style=\"margin:10px 5px 5px 10px;padding:10px 0 10px 10px;border-left:2px solid #c3d9e5;word-wrap:break-word\">\r\n<div style=\"margin:0 0 10px 0\"><b>Gesendet:</b> Mittwoch, 05. August 2020 um 09:17 Uhr<br>\r\n<b>Von:</b> &quot;Kery Marc&quot; &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">marc...@vogelwarte.ch</a>&gt;<br>\r\n<b>An:</b> &quot;&#39;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">unma...@googlegroups.com</a>&#39;&quot; &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">unma...@googlegroups.com</a>&gt;<br>\r\n<b>Betreff:</b> AW: [unmarked] JAGs examples</div>\r\n\r\n<div name=\"quoted-content\">\r\n<div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div>"
