     "<div lang=\"EN-US\" link=\"blue\" vlink=\"purple\"><div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;color:#1f497d\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n<div>\r\n<div style=\"border:none;border-top:solid #b5c4df 1.0pt;padding:3.0pt 0cm 0cm 0cm\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span lang=\"DE\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Tahoma&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\">Von:</span></b><span lang=\"DE\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Tahoma&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\"> <a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">unma...@googlegroups.com</a> [mailto:<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">unma...@googlegroups.com</a>]\r\n<b>Im Auftrag von </b>Benedikt Schmidt<br>\r\n<b>Gesendet:</b> Mittwoch, 5. August 2020 09:31<br>\r\n<b>An:</b> <a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">unma...@googlegroups.com</a><br>\r\n<b>Betreff:</b> Aw: AW: [unmarked] JAGs examples<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><u></u> <u></u></p>\r\n<div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:9.0pt;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\">Dear Josh<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:9.0pt;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\"> <u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:9.0pt;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\">The website of Mike Meredith\r\n<a href=\"https://mmeredith.net/index.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://mmeredith.net/index.htm&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792450449178000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0DrH9Ljd7dIGcyhmPWEdr-\">https://mmeredith.net/index.htm</a> is also useful.<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:9.0pt;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\"> <u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:9.0pt;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\">Best wishes<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:9.0pt;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\">Beni<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:9.0pt;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\"> <u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:9.0pt;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\"> \r\n<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:9.0pt;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\"> \r\n<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<div style=\"border:none;border-left:solid #c3d9e5 1.5pt;padding:0cm 0cm 0cm 8.0pt;margin-left:7.5pt;margin-top:7.5pt;margin-right:3.75pt;margin-bottom:3.75pt;word-wrap:break-word\" name=\"quote\">\r\n<div style=\"margin-bottom:7.5pt\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:9.0pt;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\">Gesendet:</span></b><span style=\"font-size:9.0pt;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\"> Mittwoch, 05. August 2020 um 09:17 Uhr<br>\r\n<b>Von:</b> &quot;Kery Marc&quot; &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">marc...@vogelwarte.ch</a>&gt;<br>\r\n<b>An:</b> &quot;&#39;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">unma...@googlegroups.com</a>&#39;&quot; &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">unma...@googlegroups.com</a>&gt;<br>\r\n<b>Betreff:</b> AW: [unmarked] JAGs examples<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div name=\"quoted-content\">\r\n<div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;color:#1f497d\">Dear Josh,</span><u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;color:#1f497d\"> </span><u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;color:#1f497d\">as a minimum, you could take the published code for Bayesian analysis using JAGS from R from our\r\n BPA and AHM1 books, see here:</span><u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;color:#1f497d\">-</span><span style=\"font-size:7.0pt;color:#1f497d\">         \r\n</span><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;color:#1f497d\"><a href=\"https://www.vogelwarte.ch/de/projekte/publikationen/bpa/code-for-running-bpa-using-jags\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://www.vogelwarte.ch/de/projekte/publikationen/bpa/code-for-running-bpa-using-jags&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792450449178000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2Mv2KTUFDUDqEFUDu2tFYd\">https://www.vogelwarte.ch/de/projekte/publikationen/bpa/code-for-running-bpa-using-jags</a>.\r\n Here, we still use R2jags, but doing it in jagsUI (our current preference for an R-JAGS interface) is really easy if you have code for R2jags.</span><span style=\"font-size:9.0pt;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\"><u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;color:#1f497d\">-</span><span style=\"font-size:7.0pt;color:#1f497d\">         \r\n</span><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;color:#1f497d\"><a href=\"https://www.mbr-pwrc.usgs.gov/pubanalysis/keryroylebook/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://www.mbr-pwrc.usgs.gov/pubanalysis/keryroylebook/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792450449179000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0xTuVpA4v9jxTt6aVku4tI\">https://www.mbr-pwrc.usgs.gov/pubanalysis/keryroylebook/</a>. Lots of code here.</span><span style=\"font-size:9.0pt;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\"><u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;color:#1f497d\"> </span><u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;color:#1f497d\">Best regards  -- Marc</span><u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;color:#1f497d\"> </span><u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;color:#1f497d\"> </span><u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;color:#1f497d\"> </span><u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;color:#1f497d\"> </span><u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Tahoma&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\">Von:</span></b><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Tahoma&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\"> <a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">unma...@googlegroups.com</a> [mailto:<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">unma...@googlegroups.com</a>]\r\n<b>Im Auftrag von </b>Joshua Hubbell<br>\r\n<b>Gesendet:</b> Dienstag, 4. August 2020 23:06<br>\r\n<b>An:</b> unmarked<br>\r\n<b>Betreff:</b> [unmarked] JAGs examples</span><u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"> <u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Hi unmarked users,<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"> <u></u><u></u></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">I&#39;m trying to teach myself how to implement build JAGS models in R and I was curious if anyone knew of any good online<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">resources/tutorials for how to build occupancy and n-mixture models using jagsUI. Thoughts?<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"> <u></u><u></u></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Thanks,<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"> <u></u><u></u></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Josh<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">--<br>\r\nYou received this message because you are subscribed to the Google Groups &quot;unmarked&quot; group.<br>\r\nTo unsubscribe from this group and stop receiving emails from it, send an email to\r\n<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">unmarked+u...@googlegroups.com</a>.<br>\r\nTo view this discussion on the web visit <a href=\"https://groups.google.com/d/msgid/unmarked/f874176e-bd4e-4c77-a6bd-4167b65f44e1o%40googlegroups.com?utm_medium=email&amp;utm_source=footer\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://groups.google.com/d/msgid/unmarked/f874176e-bd4e-4c77-a6bd-4167b65f44e1o%2540googlegroups.com?utm_medium%3Demail%26utm_source%3Dfooter&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792450449179000&amp;usg=AOvVaw19X-AOjwjWvmrGAfD2rmYz\">\r\nhttps://groups.google.com/d/msgid/unmarked/f874176e-bd4e-4c77-a6bd-4167b65f44e1o%40googlegroups.com</a>.<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:9.0pt;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\"> <u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:9.0pt;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\">--<br>\r\nYou received this message because you are subscribed to the Google Groups &quot;unmarked&quot; group.<br>\r\nTo unsubscribe from this group and stop receiving emails from it, send an email to\r\n<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">unmarked+u...@googlegroups.com</a>.<br>